🎯 Backend
Java 8+ (Streams, Collections, Lambdas)

Spring Boot CRUD App

DB Integration (MySQL/PostgreSQL)

REST API, Exception Handling

Profiles, Logging (SLF4J), Unit Tests

🎯 DSA
Arrays, Strings, Linked List

Stack, Queue, HashMap

Sorting Algorithms (Bubble, Merge, Quick)

LeetCode/Easy & Medium (10–12 problems/week)

Project: Bookstore or User Management API

📅 Month 2: Microservices + Docker + Cloud + DSA Intermediate
🎯 Backend/Cloud
Microservices (Eureka, Config Server)

Docker + Docker Compose

Cloud (AWS EC2, S3, RDS) OR Azure App Services

CI/CD with GitHub Actions or Jenkins

🎯 DSA
Sliding Window, Two Pointers

Recursion & Backtracking

Binary Search, Trees (BST/Binary)

LeetCode Medium (15–18 problems/week)

Mini-Project: Product + Order microservices (REST + Dockerized + Deployed)

📅 Month 3: Real Project + System Design + Advanced DSA (Optional)
🎯 Backend/Cloud
Build a real-world microservice project (Job Portal, Expense Tracker)

Secure API with JWT/OAuth2

Deploy on cloud with Docker/Kubernetes (if time permits)

